Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Episode Titles,,0000,0000,0000,,Signs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:18.24,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What on earth is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.33,0:02:04.74,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Hey Kobato, who'd you give your chocolate to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.37,0:02:07.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.39,0:02:07.80,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.31,0:02:10.88,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I gave some to...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:15.32,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka and Ioryogi and Toshihiko and...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.68,0:02:17.05,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.05,0:02:20.61,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Who'd you give your best chocolate to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.94,0:02:21.66,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:25.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I really like everyone here...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.44,0:02:29.58,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:30.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.87,0:02:31.50,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.57,0:02:36.40,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for interrupting the fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:44.36,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.92,0:02:46.89,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think you could get Sayaka for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.90,0:02:50.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.57,0:02:53.27,Default,Okiua,0000,0000,0000,,To talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.11,0:02:57.19,Default,Okiua,0000,0000,0000,,Just one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.98,0:02:59.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.52,0:03:02.32,Default,Okiua,0000,0000,0000,,Could you get out of the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:03.82,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I will not!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.89,0:03:10.50,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that's a problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.01,0:03:13.80,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.99,0:03:16.53,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.01,0:03:18.15,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Let him through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.37,0:03:23.07,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka. It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.90,0:03:34.96,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Please, if you could wait just a little bit longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.55,0:03:38.28,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,How long is "just a little bit"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.59,0:03:41.82,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,I think I've waited for quite a while already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.85,0:03:47.18,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Why... have you changed so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.77,0:03:53.59,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't. This is the real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.55,0:03:57.42,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.83,0:04:01.90,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Just give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:04.64,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Are you being stubborn because it's me you're dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.14,0:04:08.22,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,If so, you've got the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:13.64,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think of you as any more than a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.43,0:04:25.00,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,My visit here just means that this is the end, no more negotiations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.67,0:04:33.25,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Or do you want the children to watch as this place gets torn down?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.00,0:04:38.23,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,There's no reason for you to be so attached to this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.46,0:04:41.74,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,You can always open another nursery somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:43.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.45,0:04:44.96,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:47.31,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You should know better than anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.53,0:04:48.31,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.77,0:04:51.16,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That this place isn't just some building!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.16,0:04:54.89,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's something important that was handed down to Miss Sayaka from the late principal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.36,0:04:57.31,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's not exchangeable!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.11,0:05:01.35,Default,Okura,0000,0000,0000,,If it's not just a building, then what are you trying so hard to protect?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.83,0:05:05.57,Default,Okura,0000,0000,0000,,Is this building more important than the children?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.99,0:05:15.48,Default,Okura,0000,0000,0000,,If it doesn't matter that harm will come to these children then you all can just stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:22.95,Default,Okura,0000,0000,0000,,But if that's the case, I think you've got your priorities a little mixed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:24.43,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:27.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.81,0:05:35.19,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,If you'd be kind enough to hit me, then perhaps this discussion would go even faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.55,0:05:43.56,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.96,0:05:48.57,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I will close down the Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:50.99,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:56.30,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,In exchange, I'd like you to wait until the graduation ceremony is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.69,0:06:09.00,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What've you been doing over there, Dobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:11.75,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.51,0:06:14.60,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.26,0:06:21.51,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna make those sheets wet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.56,0:06:25.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.39,0:06:26.99,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.93,0:06:29.88,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't create more work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.74,0:06:32.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.61,0:06:43.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I... will go to Mr. Okiura's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:45.56,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Go and do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.56,0:06:51.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Go and ask him one more time not to destroy this Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.19,0:06:54.42,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You asking will just make a bigger mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:56.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But at this rate—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:57.45,Default Alt,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever, just don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.53,0:07:12.97,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.80,0:07:16.62,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,It's you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.49,0:07:21.82,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Why did {\i1}he{\i0} show up all of sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.82,0:07:24.69,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,At this point, what does it even matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.69,0:07:27.04,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're putting us under duress.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.04,0:07:29.31,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If we wanted to, we could sue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.34,0:07:32.96,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,If you guys could've sued, you \Nwould've done it a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.44,0:07:38.08,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,And anyway, didn't the teacher decide that she'd close down the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:41.11,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,Stop complaining and just get outta there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:45.32,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not giving up. I will protect that Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:46.48,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,How do you plan on doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:52.20,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,Idiot... saying all that even though you have no idea what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.77,0:07:56.28,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.83,0:07:58.47,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not done talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.56,0:08:02.84,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,You might think you look real cool, trying to save everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:05.99,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,but if you ask me, you're just wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.37,0:08:08.09,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.68,0:08:12.00,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,The first one to have his eye on that nursery was the president.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.00,0:08:12.88,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,President?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:15.26,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Okiura's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.90,0:08:20.18,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,The root of Yomogi Nursery's debt problem is also because
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.18,0:08:23.94,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,...the president pulled some strings and \Npushed the debt onto the previous principal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.38,0:08:25.39,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.19,0:08:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:33.16,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,The principal ran himself to the ground trying to raise money... and died because of the strain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.64,0:08:38.35,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If he knew this and still went along with his father, he's just as guilty!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.35,0:08:40.63,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I said that you just don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:44.33,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know what would happen if the \Npresident actually got serious about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.47,0:08:50.97,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,That's why Mr. Okiura took it \Nupon himself to deal with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.71,0:08:52.64,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.77,0:09:14.23,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,I think Mr. Okiura took on the role of the bad guy in order to protect the Nursery from the president.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:21.25,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,To go one step further, perhaps even to protect the woman he loves...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.36,0:09:26.25,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't give me that garbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:28.87,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,Whether you believe me or not is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:34.13,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,But you know... Kobato, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.50,0:09:36.25,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,I owe that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.09,0:09:41.76,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,So I don't want to have to make a big mess and hurt people, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.89,0:09:47.68,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,Just do as Mr. Okiura says.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.78,0:10:06.68,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,You can see everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:11.51,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Search, keep searching...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.51,0:10:16.43,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,For new wonders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.93,0:10:26.01,Default,Mother,0000,0000,0000,,All the nurseries are completely filled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:28.91,Default,Mother2,0000,0000,0000,,I'm on a waiting list as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:31.56,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry that things turned out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.21,0:10:56.67,Default,C&C,0000,0000,0000,,Please, eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:10:59.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,T-This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.21,0:11:01.99,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,If it's okay with you, won't you have dinner with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.48,0:11:05.57,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,If we all eat together, no one will be lonely, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.22,0:11:07.28,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Chise!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:17.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,T-Thanks so much for all of this, but I just can't seem to eat anything right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:27.19,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I understand. You must not be in the mood for a meal with everyone right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:29.60,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's not that! Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.53,0:11:36.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm very grateful for everyone's consideration!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.61,0:11:45.35,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Father, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.37,0:11:49.15,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't able to protect the Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:58.76,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,But you know? Even though things have turned out like this, somehow, I still want to believe in him...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.69,0:12:02.31,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure you think I'm silly, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.13,0:12:13.33,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose... I saw Mr. Okiura in front of the Nursery today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.78,0:12:17.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He looked really lonely somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.94,0:12:19.88,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:23.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Even though he was the one who told us to get out...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.43,0:12:29.67,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Okiura might still be in love with Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:33.59,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,After all, Sayaka is still in love with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.39,0:12:40.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If that's true, then why does he do things that make her sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.42,0:12:46.72,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes, {\i1}because{\i0} you love someone... \N{\i1}because{\i0} you care so strongly for them...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.48,0:12:50.11,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,misunderstandings happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.83,0:13:28.82,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's that man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.67,0:13:32.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If I follow that man, I might be able to meet with Mr. Okiura!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:33.12,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:40.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:48.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please let me meet with Mr. Okiura!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.39,0:13:51.01,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,Missy, just stay out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.53,0:13:52.80,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:13:59.32,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you meet with him, nothing will change. Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.64,0:14:02.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.53,0:14:13.54,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Chase her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.95,0:14:18.24,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I did, she doesn't seem like the type of girl who would back down that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.23,0:14:20.94,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Then leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:43.02,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,She's still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.68,0:14:45.64,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Okiura?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.39,0:14:56.20,Default,Punk,0000,0000,0000,,God dammit, every one of them... Why are they all so heated up over that nursery?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:04.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi, you're not cold, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.40,0:15:06.07,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.68,0:15:10.77,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Now that you know, why don't you go borrow an umbrella or find some shelter from this rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.77,0:15:12.10,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Come on now, use your head a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.57,0:15:20.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But if I'm not here when Mr. Okiura looks out the window, I won't be able to catch his attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.26,0:15:23.10,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you stand here, that guy isn't gonna come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.66,0:15:25.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He'll come out sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.68,0:15:27.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Even if he doesn't today, there's always tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.15,0:15:30.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And if not tomorrow, then the day after.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.37,0:15:33.25,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,How long do you plan on waiting here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.82,0:15:38.51,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Until he comes out, no matter how long it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.28,0:16:06.98,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,How long are you going to stand there for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.30,0:16:10.66,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Okiura!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.89,0:16:11.74,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.74,0:16:14.00,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have anything to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.58,0:16:18.90,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to demolish the Nursery and then use that land as collateral for the debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.90,0:16:20.81,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,And that's the end of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.81,0:16:30.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I... actually wanted to ask about something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.32,0:16:37.66,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,About your true feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.66,0:16:38.99,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Like I just said, I'm going to—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.99,0:16:40.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.17,0:16:43.61,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,You're a difficult one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.86,0:16:57.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose said that you still love Miss Sayaka and that Miss Sayaka still loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.65,0:17:03.80,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,And here I was wondering what you could possibly have to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:04.88,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Okura!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.71,0:17:11.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If Miss Sayaka really is that important to you, why did you do such a terrible thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:19.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Even though it's so important to us...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:29.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,To Miss Sayaka, to me, to Fujimoto, to everyone at Yomogi Nursery...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.75,0:17:33.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We all love that place so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.25,0:17:42.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's why... that's why I think Miss Sayaka wanted to protect it so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.61,0:17:53.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And despite all of that, you still took it away from her and made her sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.83,0:17:59.36,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I just can't imagine that you're a good person after all of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:02.74,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But even if you're not a good person...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.17,0:18:07.66,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If you're important to Miss Sayaka, then things can't go on like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.56,0:18:15.92,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please tell me why!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.05,0:18:33.71,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,We came from different worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:38.56,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't able to restrain my dad's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.25,0:18:43.54,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,That's why, now I have no choice but to protect her this way...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.78,0:18:50.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You've never hated Miss Sayaka, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.90,0:18:56.99,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You've always cared for her, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.41,0:19:03.00,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:26.50,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.05,0:19:29.22,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.99,0:19:33.36,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I just wasn't able to sleep somehow. You too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.57,0:19:35.54,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.99,0:19:41.38,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,He painted himself as the bad guy in order to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.43,0:19:43.01,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.39,0:19:45.58,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, what are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.58,0:19:46.73,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'm talking about Okiura.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:56.21,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.68,0:20:01.18,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,B-But that doesn't mean that I can just forgive—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.46,0:20:02.77,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:07.00,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't forgive him, then he has no choice but to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.00,0:20:08.30,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.29,0:20:15.77,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I... want you to be happy, Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.21,0:20:19.44,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,And besides him, there's no one else that can make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.16,0:20:24.46,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That's why you need to be with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.26,0:20:26.99,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.54,0:20:45.10,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness! You're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.71,0:20:49.09,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.80,0:20:52.61,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He said that you were standing in the rain for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.94,0:21:02.68,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,In the end, I was being protected by everyone, wasn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.27,0:21:09.21,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You and Fujimoto and him as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.23,0:21:13.30,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Where is Mr. Okiura?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.96,0:21:15.19,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He just left.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.82,0:21:17.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.25,0:21:31.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka, if you still care for Mr. Okiura... then please go after him and show him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:33.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.66,0:22:45.07,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,This is going to be a problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.30,0:22:49.91,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't forget your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.99,0:00:35.80,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(340,90)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:43.47,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)\t(\fscy140\fscx120)\move(340,90,340,45)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:38.65,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:43.24,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.27,0:00:47.25,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:50.05,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:57.39,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.81,0:01:02.97,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday,\Nyour dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.76,0:01:06.81,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:10.35,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.60,0:01:13.41,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:16.15,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.40,0:01:21.40,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.58,0:01:24.21,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.22,0:01:27.80,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.83,0:01:30.56,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.63,0:01:33.30,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.53,0:01:40.18,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.47,0:01:44.19,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:48.84,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
